  "spec_id": "g3-dev-002-l-bracket",
  "spec_text": "An L-shaped angle bracket in 5 mm plate. The horizontal leg is 60 mm long and 40 mm wide. The vertical leg rises 50 mm from the same 40 mm width, perpendicular to the horizontal leg. The two legs share the corner, so the overall height is 50 mm. Drill one 9 mm clearance hole through the vertical leg, 30 mm above the base and 12 mm in from the left-hand edge when the bracket is viewed with the horizontal leg pointing towards you.",
