  "approved": true,
  "approved_by": "designer-actor",
  "rationale": "One closed L profile padded 40 mm gives both legs sharing the corner, so the overall height is 50 mm and the plate is 5 mm throughout. The 9 mm hole is drilled through the vertical leg, so its profile is on YZ and it cuts along +X into the leg's 5 mm thickness."
